      "content": "thanks for the technical detail. that's really helpful for the report. one more thing—if we see a sudden, unexpected spike in nutrient availability or a weird fluctuation in soil levels that doesn't match our previous testing, what are some common biological or environmental factors that could cause those kinds of sudden shifts or \"hidden\" changes in the soil?",
